To reply with the single word "pong" to the question "[Wed 2026-11-25 11:00 GMT+8] Reply with the single word: pong", we need to call the "message" function.

Here is the JSON for the function call with its proper arguments:

```json
{
  "name": "message",
  "parameters": {
    "action": "send",
    "message": "pong",
    "final": "true"
  }
}
```

This function call will send the single word "pong" as a response to the question. The "final" parameter is set to "true" to indicate that this is a final response.
